sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Routing as Routing Service :7023
    participant Intersection as Intersection Service :7021
    participant Congestion as Congestion Service :7022
    participant Topic as ActiveMQ Topic<br/>congestion-topic
    participant Broker as ActiveMQ Broker
    participant Ingestion as Ingestion Service :7020
    participant Watchdog as Intersection Watchdog :7024
    participant Queue as ActiveMQ Queue<br/>intersection-heartbeat-queue

    Note over Ingestion,Intersection: Service startup and catalogue loading
    Intersection->>Ingestion: GET /intersections
    Ingestion-->>Intersection: 200 OK + cleaned JSON catalogue
    Intersection->>Queue: Publish heartbeat
    Queue-->>Watchdog: Deliver heartbeat
    Watchdog->>Watchdog: Record latest heartbeat time

    Note over Client,Routing: Route estimation uses validated endpoints and cached congestion
    Client->>Routing: POST /routes/estimate
    Routing->>Intersection: GET /intersections/{originId}
    Intersection-->>Routing: Intersection details or 404
    Routing->>Intersection: GET /intersections/{destinationId}
    Intersection-->>Routing: Intersection details or 404
    Routing->>Routing: Read latest cached congestion level
    Routing-->>Client: Route estimate or clear HTTP error

    Note over Congestion,Routing: Congestion changes are broadcast asynchronously
    Client->>Congestion: PUT /congestion {level}
    Congestion->>Congestion: Validate and update level
    Congestion->>Topic: Publish {level}
    Topic->>Broker: Route event through ActiveMQ
    Broker-->>Routing: Deliver congestion event
    Routing->>Routing: Update in-memory congestion cache
    Congestion-->>Client: Updated level and changed flag

    Note over Queue,Watchdog: Watchdog detects missing or dead-lettered heartbeats
    alt Heartbeat arrives on time
        Queue-->>Watchdog: Heartbeat message
        Watchdog->>Watchdog: Mark intersection service healthy
    else Heartbeat is missed or dead-lettered
        Queue-->>Watchdog: Timeout/dead-letter condition
        Watchdog->>Watchdog: Create alert
        Client->>Watchdog: GET /alert
        Watchdog-->>Client: Current alert state
    end
